# QA M5 relaxed run of the Wolfgangsee (D-045 measurement, M5 acceptance;
# re-cut by the level-designer for D-087's zone [16, 208]): sensible,
# non-speedrun play by the boat route, walking (no RUN) wherever Resi is on
# her own feet. Lead-in (QA's inputs, the side camera): a look around, the
# two quay Oblaten, the M-box and its Mozartkugel (Zuckerschock at 199),
# the bathing notch lesson (dive for its 3 Oblaten, strokes up, a held
# jump-out onto the quay piece 16-17), a pause by the „Raddampfer" sign,
# then she walks onto the Dampfer, which leaves; walking on along its deck
# her centre passes col 25 and the scroll starts (615, 469 frames after
# the solver's). Scroll (4096 frames, fixed): the steamer ride at the right
# clamp, the Gschwendt pier, swimming on at the clamp; from 1669 the
# inputs of wolfgangsee_solver (its 1200-2428, shifted by 469: swan #2,
# Gelse #1, under the lantern pontoon / checkpoint), then the Traundl chain
# of wolfgangsee_traundl (its 2429-3172: A, the border raft, Gelse #2
# stomped from the raft, B, C, the perch). As Zuckerschock her head is
# 8 px higher, so on the perch she steps right of the Z-box (col 173) and
# stomps Gelse #3 with a standing jump (the box stays shut), hops the perch
# bollard into the lake and walks the lake bed (DOWN + RIGHT) under swan #3
# and the three regatta boats (bed Oblaten) to the Strobl shallows' step.
# Lead-out: three strokes up, a swim to the Strobl quay and a held
# jump-out onto it (6 Oblaten), along the quay, up onto the Schiffsstation
# roof and off its end to the Maibaum. LevelComplete at 4992 = 83.2 s, no
# hurt, no death, still Zuckerschock (QA's run before D-087: 85.7 s; the
# zone is 171 frames shorter now).
